>VpBh-C
śāstreṣu niṣkṛtir dṛṣṭvā mahāpātakinām api | śaraṇāgatahātus tu na dṛṣṭvā niṣkṛtiḥ kvacit || 14 ||
>VpBh-D
śāstreṣu niṣkṛtir dṛṣṭvā mahāpātakinām api | śaraṇāgatahātus tu na dṛṣṭvā niṣkṛtiḥ kvacit || 14 ||
>MbhVp
śāstreṣu niṣkṛtir dṛṣṭā mahāpātakinām api | śaraṇāgata-hantṝṇāṃ na dṛṣṭā niṣkṛtiḥ kvacit ||
